{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The application fails to comply with the terms of Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) for the following reasons: \r\nThe submissions fails to demonstrate that the development would have safe vehicular and pedestrian access and excessive car parking is proposed. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the terms of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA, Paragraph MA.2 (2)(a) of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development)(England) Order (2015)(as amended). The proposal would also result in the change of use of the ground floor unit within 133 from a health assessment centre and this is restricted under Condition 3 of P/2015/0735. Planning permission is therefore required.\r\n"
  ],
